{"seq":1,"slug":"module-system","title":"模块系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/modules-and-declarations/module-system","wordCount":801,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块系统\">模块系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>随着前端项目规模的增长，将所有代码放在一个文件中变得不可维护。模块系统解决了三个核心问题：<strong>作用域隔离</strong>（避免全局污染）、<strong>依赖管理</strong>（明确声明文件间关系）和<strong>代码复用</strong>（跨项目共享逻辑）。</p>\n<p>TypeScript 完整支持 ES Modules 标准，并在此基础上增加了类型导入/导出的能力。理解模块系统是构建大型 TypeScript 项目的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Module System Evolution&#10;        direction LR&#10;        A[&quot;Global Script&lt;br/&gt;Script&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;CommonJS&lt;br/&gt;require/exports&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;ES Modules&lt;br/&gt;import/export&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;Type-Aware Modules&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Module System Evolution\n        direction LR\n        A[\"Global Script&lt;br/&gt;Script\"] --&gt; B[\"CommonJS&lt;br/&gt;require/exports\"] --&gt; C[\"ES Modules&lt;br/&gt;import/export\"] --&gt; D[\"TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;Type-Aware Modules\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p>在 TypeScript 中，任何包含顶层 <code>import</code> 或 <code>export</code> 语句的文件都被视为<strong>模块</strong>；否则被视为<strong>脚本</strong>，其内容在全局作用域中可见。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本语法\">基本语法</h2><h3 id=\"命名导出-named-exports\">命名导出（Named Exports）</h3><p>命名导出允许一个模块导出多个值，消费者按名称选择性导入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export interface User {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  email: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export type UserRole = &#39;admin&#39; | &#39;editor&#39; | &#39;viewer&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function createUser(name: string, email: string): User {&#10;  return { id: crypto.randomUUID(), name, email };&#10;}&#10;&#10;export const MAX_USERS = 1000;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserRole</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'editor'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'viewer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { id: crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomUUID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), name, email };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_USERS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>导入时必须使用花括号，并且名称需与导出一致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { User, UserRole, createUser, MAX_USERS } from &#39;./user&#39;;&#10;&#10;const admin: User = createUser(&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;alice@example.com&#39;);&#10;const role: UserRole = &#39;admin&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { User, UserRole, createUser, MAX_USERS } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> admin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserRole</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"默认导出-default-export\">默认导出（Default Export）</h3><p>每个模块最多有一个默认导出，导入时可自由命名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export default class Logger {&#10;  private prefix: string;&#10;&#10;  constructor(prefix: string) {&#10;    this.prefix = prefix;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  log(message: string): void {&#10;    console.log(`[${this.prefix}] ${message}`);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Logger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> prefix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.prefix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prefix;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`[${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}] ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">message</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Logger from &#39;./logger&#39;;&#10;import MyLogger from &#39;./logger&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Logger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './logger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MyLogger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './logger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"命名导出-vs-默认导出\">命名导出 vs 默认导出</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>命名导出</th>\n<th>默认导出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数量</td>\n<td>每模块可导出多个</td>\n<td>每模块最多一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导入语法</td>\n<td><code>import { name } from &quot;...&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>import name from &quot;...&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重命名</td>\n<td>需要 <code>as</code> 关键字</td>\n<td>导入时自由命名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree-shaking</td>\n<td>友好</td>\n<td>部分打包器支持较差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IDE 自动补全</td>\n<td>精确提示</td>\n<td>需要查看源码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"进阶用法\">进阶用法</h2><h3 id=\"重命名导入-导出\">重命名导入/导出</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createUser as createNewUser } from &#39;./user&#39;;&#10;&#10;export { Logger as DefaultLogger } from &#39;./logger&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createUser </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> createNewUser } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Logger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DefaultLogger } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './logger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"整体导入-namespace-import\">整体导入（Namespace Import）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import * as UserModule from &#39;./user&#39;;&#10;&#10;const user: UserModule.User = UserModule.createUser(&#39;Bob&#39;, &#39;bob@test.com&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserModule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">User</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserModule.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bob@test.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"重导出-re-exports\">重导出（Re-exports）</h3><p>将多个模块的内容聚合到一个入口文件中，这是构建库公共 API 的常见模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export { User, createUser } from &#39;./user&#39;;&#10;export { Logger } from &#39;./logger&#39;;&#10;export { default as Config } from &#39;./config&#39;;&#10;&#10;export * from &#39;./utils&#39;;&#10;export * as Validators from &#39;./validators&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { User, createUser } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Logger } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './logger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Config } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './utils'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Validators </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './validators'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Public Entry index.ts&quot;&#10;        IDX[&quot;index.ts&lt;br/&gt;(barrel file)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Internal Modules&#10;        U[&quot;user.ts&quot;] --&gt; IDX&#10;        L[&quot;logger.ts&quot;] --&gt; IDX&#10;        C[&quot;config.ts&quot;] --&gt; IDX&#10;        V[&quot;validators.ts&quot;] --&gt; IDX&#10;    end&#10;    IDX --&gt; CONSUMER[&quot;Consumer&lt;br/&gt;import from &#39;my-lib&#39;&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph \"Public Entry index.ts\"\n        IDX[\"index.ts&lt;br/&gt;(barrel file)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Internal Modules\n        U[\"user.ts\"] --&gt; IDX\n        L[\"logger.ts\"] --&gt; IDX\n        C[\"config.ts\"] --&gt; IDX\n        V[\"validators.ts\"] --&gt; IDX\n    end\n    IDX --&gt; CONSUMER[\"Consumer&lt;br/&gt;import from 'my-lib'\"]</pre><h3 id=\"动态导入-dynamic-imports\">动态导入（Dynamic Imports）</h3><p><code>import()</code> 返回 <code>Promise</code>，用于<strong>代码分割</strong>和<strong>按需加载</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function loadChart(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const { Chart } = await import(&#39;./chart&#39;);&#10;  const chart = new Chart(&#39;container&#39;);&#10;  chart.render();&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Locale = &#39;zh&#39; | &#39;en&#39; | &#39;ja&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function loadLocale(lang: Locale): Promise&lt;Record&lt;string, string&gt;&gt; {&#10;  const module = await import(`./locales/${lang}.json`);&#10;  return module.default;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadChart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Chart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./chart'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Chart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'container'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chart.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zh'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'en'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ja'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadLocale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lang</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Locale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`./locales/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lang</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.json`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.default;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TypeScript 会正确推断动态导入返回的模块类型，IDE 中可获得完整的类型补全。</p>\n<h3 id=\"仅类型导入-导出\">仅类型导入/导出</h3><p>TypeScript 3.8 引入了 <code>import type</code> 语法，确保导入内容在编译后完全擦除：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import type { User } from &#39;./user&#39;;&#10;import { createUser, type UserRole } from &#39;./user&#39;;&#10;&#10;export type { User };&#10;export { type UserRole, createUser };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { User } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createUser, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserRole } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { User };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserRole, createUser };</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型推断与约束\">类型推断与约束</h2><h3 id=\"模块-vs-脚本上下文\">模块 vs 脚本上下文</h3><p>TypeScript 根据文件是否包含顶层 <code>import</code>/<code>export</code> 来决定文件的解析模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// script.ts — 脚本模式，变量泄漏到全局&#10;const globalValue = 42;&#10;&#10;// module.ts — 模块模式，作用域隔离&#10;export const localValue = 42;&#10;&#10;// 将脚本强制转为模块的技巧&#10;export {};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// script.ts — 脚本模式，变量泄漏到全局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> globalValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// module.ts — 模块模式，作用域隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> localValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 将脚本强制转为模块的技巧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模块解析策略\">模块解析策略</h3><p>TypeScript 提供多种模块解析策略，通过 <code>tsconfig.json</code> 中的 <code>moduleResolution</code> 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;module&quot;: &quot;esnext&quot;,&#10;    &quot;moduleResolution&quot;: &quot;bundler&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"esnext\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"moduleResolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bundler\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>解析行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>node16</code></td>\n<td>Node.js ESM 项目</td>\n<td>遵循 Node.js ESM 解析规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nodenext</code></td>\n<td>Node.js 最新版</td>\n<td>与 <code>node16</code> 类似，跟随 Node 更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bundler</code></td>\n<td>Webpack / Vite 等打包器</td>\n<td>允许无扩展名导入，最宽松</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>classic</code></td>\n<td>遗留项目</td>\n<td>TypeScript 早期解析，已不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    IMPORT[&quot;import { foo } from &#39;./bar&#39;&quot;]&#10;    IMPORT --&gt; RES{&quot;moduleResolution?&quot;}&#10;    RES --&gt;|&quot;bundler&quot;| B1[&quot;./bar.ts → ./bar/index.ts&quot;]&#10;    RES --&gt;|&quot;node16&quot;| B2[&quot;Must Include Extension&lt;br/&gt;./bar.js&quot;]&#10;    RES --&gt;|&quot;nodenext&quot;| B3[&quot;Same as node16&lt;br/&gt;Follows Node.js Evolution&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; OK[&quot;✅ Resolution Success&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; OK&#10;    B3 --&gt; OK\">flowchart TD\n    IMPORT[\"import { foo } from './bar'\"]\n    IMPORT --&gt; RES{\"moduleResolution?\"}\n    RES --&gt;|\"bundler\"| B1[\"./bar.ts → ./bar/index.ts\"]\n    RES --&gt;|\"node16\"| B2[\"Must Include Extension&lt;br/&gt;./bar.js\"]\n    RES --&gt;|\"nodenext\"| B3[\"Same as node16&lt;br/&gt;Follows Node.js Evolution\"]\n    B1 --&gt; OK[\"✅ Resolution Success\"]\n    B2 --&gt; OK\n    B3 --&gt; OK</pre><h3 id=\"路径映射\">路径映射</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;baseUrl&quot;: &quot;.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paths&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;@/*&quot;: [&quot;src/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@components/*&quot;: [&quot;src/components/*&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"baseUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@components/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/components/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Button } from &#39;@components/Button&#39;;&#10;import { apiClient } from &#39;@/services/api&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@components/Button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { apiClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/services/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"组织大型项目的模块结构\">组织大型项目的模块结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/&#10;├── index.ts              # 应用入口&#10;├── types/&#10;│   └── index.ts          # 共享类型定义&#10;├── services/&#10;│   ├── index.ts          # 服务层 barrel&#10;│   ├── auth.service.ts&#10;│   └── user.service.ts&#10;├── utils/&#10;│   ├── index.ts          # 工具层 barrel&#10;│   ├── date.ts&#10;│   └── validation.ts&#10;└── models/&#10;    ├── index.ts          # 模型层 barrel&#10;    ├── user.model.ts&#10;    └── order.model.ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── index.ts              # 应用入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── types/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── index.ts          # 共享类型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── services/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── index.ts          # 服务层 barrel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── auth.service.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── user.service.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── utils/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── index.ts          # 工具层 barrel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── date.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── validation.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── models/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── index.ts          # 模型层 barrel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── user.model.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── order.model.ts</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"构建库的公共-api\">构建库的公共 API</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/index.ts — 库的唯一入口&#10;export { createApp, type AppConfig } from &#39;./app&#39;;&#10;export { Router, type Route } from &#39;./router&#39;;&#10;export { Store, type StoreOptions } from &#39;./store&#39;;&#10;&#10;export type { Plugin, PluginContext } from &#39;./plugin&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/index.ts — 库的唯一入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createApp, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AppConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Router, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Route } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Store, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StoreOptions } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './store'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Plugin, PluginContext } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './plugin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"条件导出与环境适配\">条件导出与环境适配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-lib&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/esm/index.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: &quot;./dist/cjs/index.cjs&quot;,&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/types/index.d.ts&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-lib\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/esm/index.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/cjs/index.cjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/types/index.d.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    PKG[&quot;my-lib&quot;]&#10;    PKG --&gt;|&quot;ESM Environment&quot;| ESM[&quot;dist/esm/index.js&quot;]&#10;    PKG --&gt;|&quot;CJS Environment&quot;| CJS[&quot;dist/cjs/index.cjs&quot;]&#10;    PKG --&gt;|&quot;Type Checking&quot;| DTS[&quot;dist/types/index.d.ts&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    PKG[\"my-lib\"]\n    PKG --&gt;|\"ESM Environment\"| ESM[\"dist/esm/index.js\"]\n    PKG --&gt;|\"CJS Environment\"| CJS[\"dist/cjs/index.cjs\"]\n    PKG --&gt;|\"Type Checking\"| DTS[\"dist/types/index.d.ts\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ES Modules</strong> 是 TypeScript 推荐的模块方案，使用 <code>import</code>/<code>export</code> 进行依赖管理。</li>\n<li><strong>命名导出</strong>对 Tree-shaking 和 IDE 补全更友好，<strong>默认导出</strong>适合模块只有单一职责时使用。</li>\n<li><strong>重导出</strong>（barrel files）可以聚合内部模块，为消费者提供简洁的公共 API。</li>\n<li><strong>动态导入</strong> <code>import()</code> 返回 Promise，是代码分割和按需加载的基础。</li>\n<li><strong><code>import type</code></strong> 确保类型信息在编译时完全擦除，避免不必要的运行时依赖。</li>\n<li><strong>模块解析策略</strong>的选择取决于运行环境：Node.js 项目用 <code>node16</code>/<code>nodenext</code>，打包器项目用 <code>bundler</code>。</li>\n<li>合理的模块组织结构和路径映射能显著提升大型项目的可维护性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模块系统","id":"模块系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本语法","id":"基本语法"},{"level":3,"text":"命名导出（Named Exports）","id":"命名导出-named-exports"},{"level":3,"text":"默认导出（Default Export）","id":"默认导出-default-export"},{"level":3,"text":"命名导出 vs 默认导出","id":"命名导出-vs-默认导出"},{"level":2,"text":"进阶用法","id":"进阶用法"},{"level":3,"text":"重命名导入/导出","id":"重命名导入-导出"},{"level":3,"text":"整体导入（Namespace Import）","id":"整体导入-namespace-import"},{"level":3,"text":"重导出（Re-exports）","id":"重导出-re-exports"},{"level":3,"text":"动态导入（Dynamic Imports）","id":"动态导入-dynamic-imports"},{"level":3,"text":"仅类型导入/导出","id":"仅类型导入-导出"},{"level":2,"text":"类型推断与约束","id":"类型推断与约束"},{"level":3,"text":"模块 vs 脚本上下文","id":"模块-vs-脚本上下文"},{"level":3,"text":"模块解析策略","id":"模块解析策略"},{"level":3,"text":"路径映射","id":"路径映射"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"组织大型项目的模块结构","id":"组织大型项目的模块结构"},{"level":3,"text":"构建库的公共 API","id":"构建库的公共-api"},{"level":3,"text":"条件导出与环境适配","id":"条件导出与环境适配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型体操入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/advanced-type-system/type-level-programming"},"next":{"title":"声明文件与类型声明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/modules-and-declarations/declaration-files"}}